          <p class="t-lead">I build systems tools in Rust and Go alongside web applications in TypeScript and Python.</p>
          <p>Recent work spans an offline Rust DAW, an experimental Limine kernel, a Kubernetes and ArgoCD GitOps setup, and web platforms for Team ALAZ #12368, Çiğli SKAL, and Rıdvan Otel.</p>
          <ul class="about-facts">
            <li>GitHub: {PROFILE.handle} ({PROFILE.repoCount} public repositories)</li>
            <li>Languages: Rust, Go, Python, TypeScript, Java</li>
            <li>Tools: Kubernetes, Docker, Linux, Next.js, Django, Astro</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="about-links">
            <a class="link" href={PROFILE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
            <a class="link" href={PROFILE.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
            <a class="link" href={`mailto:${PROFILE.email}`}>Send email</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="frame frame--split span-6 start-7">
          <div class="dg" data-diagram data-dg-still data-icon-base="/assets/icons">
            <script type="application/json" set:html={stackDiagram} />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
